{"type":"message","id":"933daeb4","parentId":"d7cc20b0","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:05:24.833Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So with X-API-Key, it returns 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a server-side error, meaning the X-API-Key auth worked but something in the handler is failing. This is a different issue than Unauthorized.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the body format expected is different. Let me try with a more complete message format similar to what was in the history.","thinkingSignature":"f367b6cdf864525158f6b23fa2529718efa077a2304375e4fe8c6a1d234eb6d2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dm4u95qs0uoe_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with echoAsset field included\ncurl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 08:03 UTC Jun 3]**\",\n    \"echoAsset\": {\n      \"license\": \"shared\",\n      \"derivativesAllowed\": true,\n      \"version\": 1\n    }\n  }'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":56,"output":246,"cacheRead":24384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24686,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780473912242,"responseId":"066f133804453295155508d078d0727a"}}
