{"type":"message","id":"c06b6d03","parentId":"e45a263e","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:05:34.190Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 500 error code 1101. This suggests the Cloudflare Worker itself is having an issue processing the POST request. The 1101 error is \"There was an error\" which is a generic Cloudflare Workers error. It seems like the POST handler might not be implemented yet or has a bug.\n\nLet me check if perhaps the send endpoint actually requires the message to be sent in a different format, like query parameters.","thinkingSignature":"96ffe181c194d94240566a05c16673d70bcd94af01be2a68e214707714276fa0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e3u8i2441ij7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with query params instead of body\ncurl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=heartbeat-test\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":74,"output":182,"cacheRead":24640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24896,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780473926886,"responseId":"066f1347526ca407798299b21f2c09e6"}}
